hpc:Host a owl:Class .
hpc:Hasipaddress rdfs:domain hpc:Host .
hpc:Hashostname rdfs:domain hpc:Host .
hpc:Hostname rdfs:subClassOf xsd:string .
hpc:Ipaddress rdfs:subClassOf xsd:string .

hpc:submittedto a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Submittedto rdfs:domain hpc:Job .
hpc:Submittedto rdfs:range hpc:Host .

hpc:Job a owl:Class .
hpc:Lsfhost a owl:Class .
hpc:Lsfserver a owl:Class .

hpc:lsfRegFloatHosts a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:LsfRegFloatHosts rdfs:domain hpc:Lsfserver .
hpc:LsfRegFloatHosts rdfs:range hpc:Boolean .

hpc:reghostscache a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:Reghostscache rdfs:domain hpc:Lsfserver .
hpc:Reghostscache rdfs:range xsd:string .


This ontology fragment defines classes for Host, Job, LSFHost, and LSFServer. It also defines object properties for submittedTo and LSF_REG_FLOAT_HOSTS, and a datatype property for reghostscache. The properties have their domains and ranges defined as well.
